    <td width=75% bgcolor="#6E94B7"><font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size=2><b>&nbsp;Members and Friends / Guides / <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?board=13;action=display;num=1043686826;start=4"><font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size=2><u>Re: Equipment Questions</u></font></a></b></font></td>
    <td align=right bgcolor="#6E94B7"><nobr>&nbsp;<font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size=2>on: Jan 30<sup>th</sup>, 2003, 2:47pm&nbsp;</font></nobr></td>
  </tr><tr>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#DEE7EF" class="catbg"><font class="catbg" size=2>Started by <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?action=viewprofile;username=Talmarr" alt="View Profile: Talmarr">Talmarr</a> | Last post by <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?action=viewprofile;username=Talmarr" alt="View Profile: Talmarr">Talmarr</a></font></td>
  </tr><tr height=80>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#D8F8F8" valign=top><font size=2>Again, thanks for the great info. &nbsp;If we need actual specific information, maybe we can turn to a log analyzer to figure out damage, etc. &nbsp;However, damage doesn't always equate to aggro. <br> &nbsp;<br> If nothing more, I'll just make sure we have a rogue with pretty poor evade skills in the group, that way the casters will be OK. <img border=0 src=http://www.eq-eod.com/YaBBImages/wink.gif> <br> &nbsp;<br> I'll look into getting some of the weapons you've discussed. &nbsp;I'll probably be able to be on this weekend to play and will investigate more then. <br> &nbsp;<br> Thanks again <br> </font></td>
  </tr><tr>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#DEE7EF"><font size=2>&nbsp;
<a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?board=13;action=post;num=1043686826;start=4;title=Post+reply"><img src="http://www.eq-eod.com/YaBBImages/reply.gif" alt="Reply" border="0"> <font size="1" class="imgcatbg">Reply</font></a> <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?board=13;action=post;num=1043686826;quote=4;title=Post+reply"><img src="http://www.eq-eod.com/YaBBImages/quote.gif" alt="Quote" border="0"> <font size="1" class="imgwindowbg">Quote</font></a> <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?board=13;action=notify;thread=1043686826;start="><img src="http://www.eq-eod.com/YaBBImages/notify.gif" alt="Notify of replies" border="0"> <font size="1" class="imgcatbg">Notify of replies</font></a>
