    <td align=right bgcolor="#6E94B7"><nobr>&nbsp;<font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size=2>on: Jan 29<sup>th</sup>, 2003, 3:46pm&nbsp;</font></nobr></td>
  </tr><tr>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#DEE7EF" class="catbg"><font class="catbg" size=2>Started by <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?action=viewprofile;username=dalathin" alt="View Profile: Tomah">Dalathin Drukane</a> | Last post by <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?action=viewprofile;username=Tomah" alt="View Profile: Tomah">Tomah</a></font></td>
  </tr><tr height=80>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#D8F8F8" valign=top><font size=2>Like.... wow dude <img border=0 src=http://www.eq-eod.com/YaBBImages/smiley.gif> <br> &nbsp;<br> I'm all game for WW dragons, but yeah, we'd need you White to bring a group or two, we can sometimes muster 1-2 groups of 50+ but I don't think that's enough. <br> &nbsp;<br> As far as faction, well, I don't know what the faction is needed for, but so far bad faction has not impeded my game play for the past 3 years, so no matter to me. &nbsp;If it ever becomes a big deal, then killing enough in Kael Drakkel should fix it. <br> &nbsp;<br> Either way, hunting in WW is up to you White to bring the big guns <img border=0 src=http://www.eq-eod.com/YaBBImages/smiley.gif> </font></td>
  </tr><tr>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#DEE7EF"><font size=2>&nbsp;
<a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?board=4;action=post;num=1043678196;start=10;title=Post+reply"><img src="http://www.eq-eod.com/YaBBImages/reply.gif" alt="Reply" border="0"> <font size="1" class="imgcatbg">Reply</font></a> <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?board=4;action=post;num=1043678196;quote=10;title=Post+reply"><img src="http://www.eq-eod.com/YaBBImages/quote.gif" alt="Quote" border="0"> <font size="1" class="imgwindowbg">Quote</font></a> <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?board=4;action=notify;thread=1043678196;start="><img src="http://www.eq-eod.com/YaBBImages/notify.gif" alt="Notify of replies" border="0"> <font size="1" class="imgcatbg">Notify of replies</font></a>
