    <td align=left bgcolor="#6E94B7"><font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size=2>&nbsp;4&nbsp;</font></td>
    <td width=75% bgcolor="#6E94B7"><font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size=2><b>&nbsp;Members and Friends / Adventures in Norrath / <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?board=14;action=display;num=1020667731;start=45"><font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size=2><u>n00b dAzE</u></font></a></b></font></td>
    <td align=right bgcolor="#6E94B7"><nobr>&nbsp;<font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size=2>on: Jan 29<sup>th</sup>, 2003, 3:34pm&nbsp;</font></nobr></td>
  </tr><tr>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#DEE7EF" class="catbg"><font class="catbg" size=2>Started by <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?action=viewprofile;username=Skulbasher" alt="View Profile: Skulbasher">Skulbasher</a> | Last post by <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?action=viewprofile;username=Skulbasher" alt="View Profile: Skulbasher">Skulbasher</a></font></td>
  </tr><tr height=80>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#D8F8F8" valign=top><font size=2>  &quot;I want to buy the FBR and the staff,&quot; DUnno told Fingery. <br> &nbsp; &quot;Ok, meet me at POD,&quot; Fingery replied. <br> &nbsp; &quot;I want the POD staff,&quot; Dunno replied. <br> &nbsp; &quot;Meet at POD.&quot; <br> &nbsp; Dunno blinked.  &quot;Where are you?&quot; he asked Fingery. <br> &nbsp; &quot;POD?&quot; Fingery replied. <br> &nbsp; &quot;Yes, I said I want the POD, but where are you?&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;I'm at the POD.&quot; <br> &nbsp; Dunno growled.  &quot;I know you have the POD, but I don't know where that is.&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;Right next to me.&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;It's on the ground next to you?&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;That's right.&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;Quick, pick it up!  Someone might come along and grab it!&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;I can't do that, noob,&quot; Fingery said. <br> &nbsp; &quot;Can I pick it up?&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;No.  Nobody can pick up the POD, stoopid.&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;You're trying to sell me something I can't even pick up?&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;sigh&quot; Fingery said.  &quot;I have the POD staff in my hand, and I am by the POD elevator.  Come and get it.&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;Oh,&quot; Dunno said.  &quot;So they are two different things.&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;Yes.&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;Where is the POD elevator?&quot; Dunno asked. <br> &nbsp; &quot;Grrrr....&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;I'm new to the game.&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;Really?&quot; Fingery replied.  &quot;Never could have guessed...&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;Right now, I just died and appeared by this elevator platform, and there are two guards here, and a guy in black robes with a kewl staff with a skull on top.  He looks bad-ass.&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;You are by that elevator right now?&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;Yes.&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;That's the POD!&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;You sure?  There's also a little scrawny short guy wearing purple armor, he looks like a tiny can of gay sardines.&quot; <br> &nbsp; There was a long pause, and the short purple-armored man ran over to Dunno. <br> &nbsp; &quot;This is me,&quot; Fingery said, growling. <br> &nbsp; &quot;Oh, ok, how much for the stuff?&quot; <br> &nbsp; Fingery made a rude gesture at Dunno.  &quot;10kp&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;Hey!  That wasn't very nice.  Ten thousand platinum??  Lemme guess, you hit the wrong hotkey.&quot; <br> &nbsp; &quot;No, I'm pretty sure I hit the right one,&quot; Fingery replied. </font></td>
  </tr><tr>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#DEE7EF"><font size=2>&nbsp;
